 - **arXiv:2508.01969 - "Accelerating LLM Reasoning via Early Rejection with Partial Reward Modeling":** Track: FR-11 v20 Tier-3-as-fast-path. Hypothesis confirmed in-paper that PRMs are also *Partial* Reward Models -- scores on partially-completed steps become highly predictive of the final reward after surprisingly short prefixes, enabling early rejection of unpromising trajectories. Direct conceptual anchor for wiring the `.347 Tier-3 predictor (predictive AUROC 0.9715, exp3788) into a deployable fast-path/early-exit cascade gate that skips full ensemble scoring when the predictor is confident. Token/latency-saving numbers are source-reported only.
